# Ad-hoc headless verification scripts (see CLAUDE.md). Written at the repo
# root so playwright-core resolves, which means `git add -A` keeps sweeping
# them in — this has happened twice. Real scripts live in scripts/, so any
# root-level .mjs is by definition a throwaway probe (playtest*/probe*/verify*
# from playtest agents included).
/shot.mjs
/probe-*.ts
/*.png
/*.mjs
